text:
Zoe Park: Quick thought 1 run a compact micro-launch for 'Prompt Templates' tied to starter credits. Two arms: RSVP-claim 50 vs instant 150. 10-day run, focused on clean 7-day activation signal. Need landing, 3 social posts, routing tag, and a short onboarding nudge A/B.

Caleb Turner: Sounds good. Recommend sample 800 users/arm. Track events: template_view, template_apply, credits_claimed, tokens_used. Also plan a day-7 reengagement for non-activated users.

Anika Rao: I'll draft quick email + landing copy. Proposed webinar title: 'Prompt Templates: Ship Useful Prompts Faster'. Teaser copy for social: 'Templates that actually work 1 see a live demo.'

Zoe Park: Routing note  ensure signup links include ?exp=tpl_rsvp or tpl_open and surface cohort in CRM. Small snippet: 

```
if (q.exp === 'tpl_rsvp') {
  crm.tag(user, 'exp:tpl_rsvp');
  route('sales_ae', 'high');
} else {
  crm.tag(user, 'exp:tpl_open');
  route('growth_inbound', 'normal');
}
```

Anika Rao: I'll upload copy + a 1-slide demo deck to the shared doc by EOD.

Caleb Turner: I'll wire the events and toss a simple funnel dashboard together. Day3/day7/day10 snapshots.

OpsBot: Experiment registered: id=exp_tpl_mini_202405  dashboard: https://growth.internal/exp/exp_tpl_mini_202405. Budget cap 200k tokens/arm. Alerts enabled.

Zoe Park: Great  owners: Anika (copy + slides), Caleb (metrics), me (comms + social). Launch target Mon 2024-05-13. Post links here when ready and we'll review numbers on Tuesday sync. :rocket:
